Package: wolfetch
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: tiny and fast system fetch for Linux and BSD
 wolfetch prints a concise system summary beside a minimal wolf.
 It does not require systemd or a background service.
